//
// This file is for Player combat mods. It is used when a player is the
// caster.
//

// PvPToHitMod
// When a dead or alive Player or pet of a player is targetting a dead or 
// alive Foe who is a player or a pet of a player, this value is directly 
// added to the ToHit value.

PvPToHitMod -0.25
PvPElusivityMod 0.0

